---
// Entrance (index.astro)
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>中村達希 | Tatsuki Nakamura</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <meta name="description" content="ようこそ。研究の記録も、なにげない日常も、気になるところからゆっくりのぞいてみてください。">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-research: #FFFFFF;
      --bg-daily: #F7F3EC;
      --ink-main: #1C1915;
      --ink-sub: #556270;
      --boundary: #E3DCD0;
    }
    body, html {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink-main);
      background-color: var(--bg-research);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .welcome-header {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2.5rem 8% 1.5rem;
      font-family: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--ink-main);
    }
    .split-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      min-height: 55vh;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--boundary);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--boundary);
    }
    .split-pane {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 4.5rem 12%;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .split-pane:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--ink-main);
      outline-offset: -3px;
    }
    .pane-research { background-color: var(--bg-research); }
    .pane-research:hover { background-color: #FAFAFA; }
    .pane-daily {
      background-color: var(--bg-daily);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--boundary);
    }
    .pane-daily:hover { background-color: #F0EAE0; }
    .scent-label {
      margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--ink-sub);
    }
    .scent-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-family: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .arrow-icon {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--ink-main);
      stroke-width: 1.5;
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }
    .split-pane:hover .arrow-icon { transform: translateX(12px); }

    .bottom-guide-area {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 5.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-research) 0%, #FAF8F5 100%);
    }
    .bottom-guide-inner {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-family: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      color: var(--ink-main);
      text-align: left;
    }
    .bottom-guide-catch {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--ink-main);
    }
    .bottom-guide-desc {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 2.0;
      color: var(--ink-sub);
      margin: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .welcome-header { padding: 2rem 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
      .split-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        min-height: auto;
      }
      .pane-daily {
        border-left: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--boundary);
      }
      .split-pane { padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem; }
      .bottom-guide-area { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4.5rem; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .arrow-icon { transition: none; }
      .split-pane:hover .arrow-icon { transform: none; }
      .split-pane { transition: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="welcome-header">
    <p>ようこそ。研究の記録も、なにげない日常も、気になるところからゆっくりのぞいてみてください。</p>
  </header>

  <main class="split-layout" aria-label="二つの入口">
    <a href="/portal/" class="split-pane pane-research">
      <p class="scent-label">研究サイト</p>
      <h2 class="scent-title">助けを求められなかった真因を、<br>心ではなく仕組みから探る</h2>
      <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <a href="/life/" class="split-pane pane-daily">
      <p class="scent-label">日常</p>
      <h2 class="scent-title">なにげない1日も<br>ここに書きとめる</h2>
      <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </main>

  <footer class="bottom-guide-area">
    <div class="bottom-guide-inner">
      <h3 class="bottom-guide-catch">研究のメモも、毎日あったことも、ここにあるよ。</h3>
      <p class="bottom-guide-desc">
        長い時間をかけて集めてきた資料やメモ、日常の出来事の記録をひとまとめにして、読みやすい形に整理することをねらいにしています。気になるところから、どうぞのぞいてみてね。
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
